      "text": "Create -> Realtime Visual Whiteboard\n\nuses:\nReact.js -> Frontend\nHTML Canvas + FabricJS -> for drawing freature\nWebSocket -> For real-time Collaboration\nNode.js -> backend\nRedis -> to keep states in sync\n\nFeatures are:\n1. Mess Cleanup (toggle button)\n    - users draw random things (text, diagram, icons, so on)\n    in random places.\n    - when toggle on --> all the things are properly aligned.\n2. Architecture assist (toggle button)\n    - user draw rough diagram\n    - then user toggle on --> users get suggestions:\n        * Which API's you should use\n        * where you should go in DBMS\n        * what more you should add\n        * what are missing here\n        * how to make it better and scalable\n        * how to enhance the performance.\n3. Context-Layer:\n    - Adding notes in each elements (if user want)\n    - like attaching (link, code snippet, file attach)\n\nNow it's become proper executational architecture.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Create -> Realtime Visual Whiteboard\n\nuses:\nReact.js -> Frontend\nHTML Canvas + FabricJS -> for drawing freature\nWebSocket -> For real-time Collaboration\nNode.js -> backend\nRedis -> to keep states in sync\n\nFeatures are:\n1. Mess Cleanup (toggle button)\n    - users draw random things (text, diagram, icons, so on)\n    in random places.\n    - when toggle on --> all the things are properly aligned.\n2. Architecture assist (toggle button)\n    - user draw rough diagram\n    - then user toggle on --> users get suggestions:\n        * Which API's you should use\n        * where you should go in DBMS\n        * what more you should add\n        * what are missing here\n        * how to make it better and scalable\n        * how to enhance the performance.\n3. Context-Layer:\n    - Adding notes in each elements (if user want)\n    - like attaching (link, code snippet, file attach)\n\nNow it's become proper executational architecture.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
