      "text": "FRONTEND:\nhow many pages I need to create for make this project like\na production level.\n\n\nBACKEND\nDoes I need to save the user data?\n    - I don't have to save any kind of data.\n\nHow efficently save the user recent acitivity in the RAM/localstorage\nfor quick access, when user visit again on the site.\n- set an expire of the user data which is saved, for the memory\nconcern.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FRONTEND:\nhow many pages I need to create for make this project like\na production level.\n\n\nBACKEND\nDoes I need to save the user data?\n    - I don't have to save any kind of data.\n\nHow efficently save the user recent acitivity in the RAM/localstorage\nfor quick access, when user visit again on the site.\n- set an expire of the user data which is saved, for the memory\nconcern.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
